    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύσχλοι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύχλοι</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδημάτιόν τι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύοχλον</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύσχλον</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδημα ἀνδρεῖον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕπτυσχλοι</span> (quod fort.
			legend.).</div>
